Vetra.jl is a native Julia port of treeform/pixie:
https://github.com/treeform/pixie

Upstream copyright:
Copyright (c) 2020 Andre von Houck and Ryan Oldenburg

The upstream MIT license is reproduced verbatim in third_party/upstream.LICENSE.
The source revision used for porting is recorded in upstream.toml.

This port includes translated graphics implementation from the upstream
source (T002-T010); translated files keep their file-level upstream
references. The port also translates code from these MIT-licensed
Nim packages (pinned in .reference/pkgs/, per upstream.toml):
vmath (Andre von Houck, MIT, geometry), chroma (Andre von Houck, MIT,
color types/blends), bumpy (Andre von Houck, MIT, segments/arcs),
flatty (Andre von Houck, MIT, font table decoding), nimsimd and
zippy (Ryan Oldenburg, MIT, used only where upstream uses them).
Optional codec dependencies added for T008 (D014) and their
licenses:

- PNGFiles.jl (f57f5aa1-a3ce-4bc8-8ab9-96f992907883), MIT:
  Copyright (c) 2019 Ian Butterworth, Tomáš Drvoštěp (and contributors).
- JpegTurbo.jl (b835a17e-a41a-41e7-81f0-2f016b05efe0), MIT; wraps
  libjpeg-turbo (IJG-derived, IJG/Public Domain-style licensing).
- XML.jl (72c71f33-b9b6-44de-8c94-c961784809e2), MIT.
- ColorTypes.jl (3da002f7-5984-5a60-b8a6-cbb66c0b333f), MIT
  (Copyright (c) 2015 Timothy E. Holy and Simon Danisch), used for the
  opt-in color-matrix interop added in T015 (D024); it brings in
  FixedPointNumbers.jl (53c48c17-4a7d-5ca2-90c5-79b7896eea93), MIT
  (Copyright (c) 2014 Jeff Bezanson and other contributors).

Test fixtures under test/reference/ are generated by tools/oracle from
the pinned upstream repository (MIT, per above) plus its bundled test
assets: the format masters (BMP/QOI/GIF/JPEG/SVG, incl. the
Ghostscript-Tiger SVG and the USC-SIPI mandrill test image, which carry
no per-asset license notices in the upstream repository and are
distributed under it), the square/line/heart example outputs, and the
ctx_rot rotation regression fixture. Each fixture's .meta records repo,
revision, toolchain and generator.

